          "description": "Create and populate a model in one call: sim specs, stocks, auxiliaries, flows, connectors, and modules. All-or-nothing — on any item error nothing is registered and the error names the failing item (stage + index). Connector sync and validation run by default, so the response doubles as an inspection.",
